122 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 45 0 R
/E (The Task Management System and Reminder is an information system designed to help users organize, manage, and track their daily tasks efficiently. The system allows users to create tasks, set deadlines, update task details, mark tasks as completed, and receive reminders for important activities. MIS helps collect and store task-related information and provides useful information to users for better planning and decision-making. The system reduces the chances of forgetting important tasks and improves time management and productivity. It provides accurate and timely information about pending, completed, and upcoming tasks in a simple and organized manner.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [38]
>>
